@startuml
title AstrBot 接入 NapCat 的消息链与验证点
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  BackgroundColor #FEFCE8
}

top to bottom direction

actor "测试账号" as user
rectangle "QQ / NTQQ\n账号已登录" as qq
rectangle "NapCat\nOneBot v11 协议实现" as napcat
rectangle "AstrBot OneBot 适配器\n监听 127.0.0.1:6199/ws" as adapter
rectangle "AstrBot 消息处理\n路由、会话、人格、插件" as pipeline
rectangle "模型 Provider\n生成回复" as model

user --> qq : ① 发送普通文本
qq --> napcat : ② 产生消息事件
napcat --> adapter : ③ 反向 WebSocket\n客户端主动连接服务端
adapter --> pipeline : ④ 事件进入 handler
pipeline --> model : ⑤ 模型请求
model --> pipeline : ⑥ 模型结果
pipeline --> adapter : ⑦ send_msg 动作
adapter --> napcat : ⑧ OneBot 动作
napcat --> qq : ⑨ QQ 接受消息
qq --> user : ⑩ 收到回复

note right of napcat
  NapCat WebUI 端口只负责管理
  不能代替 OneBot 连接端口
end note

note right of adapter
  验证日志：
  adapter connected
end note

note right of model
  单独使用 Provider Test
  检查 API Base、Key、模型 ID
end note

@enduml
